.TH RISESTOTHRONE 8 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.7" "System Daemons"
.SH NAME
risestothrone \- farewell guardian: finish and remember
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B risestothrone mark|farewell
.RB ( run by systemd, not by hand )
.SH DESCRIPTION
Ordered to stop before Odysseus, second-to-last voice. At boot it
marks the throne; at shutdown it waits out critical work (backup,
vault, dpkg lock - max 60s), archives the Oracle feed tail to
.IR /var/log/farewell.log ,
writes the final kernel line to
.IR /var/log/last-words.log ,
and syncs. Named for Terry's last video.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR oracle (8),
.BR odysseus (8)
